  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70ef0d4fba52fdea",
      "translationZh": "嗨 r/LocalLLaMA。我在香港的 Blockway 小团队工作（披露：这是我们的模型）。今天我们发布了 Agens Volundr 32B Preview，这是首个基于我们自研混合架构的模型。我们在有限算力下进行训练，模型并不完美，我们宁愿提前告知它的不足之处。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d373eb88d6ee7a6",
      "translationZh": "我们的客户在自己的机器上运行模型。在长上下文场景中，决定能否容纳的是 KV 缓存，而不是模型权重。因此我们设计了一种模型，使大多数层不保留 KV 缓存。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7a1ea88774e2c52",
      "translationZh": "架构（72 层，稠密约 32 B，每层在每个标记上运行）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "232c7d1dac1d6dd2",
      "translationZh": "54 层 KDA（Kimi Delta Attention）：线性注意力，使用固定大小的循环状态，无 KV 缓存",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31285cd6389eecd8",
      "translationZh": "17 层 BCSA（我们的压缩稀疏注意力）：对最近的 4,096 个标记使用精确窗口；较早的上下文以 4:1 的比例池化成块，并由学习型索引器读取前 512 个块",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37b66c8b69f20b6f",
      "translationZh": "1 个全注意力层（第 72 层）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e9a5fc6ff4f0c4f",
      "translationZh": "Engram：一种存储在主机 RAM 中的哈希 n-gram 记忆，附着在 72 层中的第 2 层",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3adeab8fa8c27bd2",
      "translationZh": "mHC：4 条残差流，而不是 1 条",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cab9e1c03d757f3",
      "translationZh": "因此，只有 72 层中的 18 层保留 KV 缓存。上下文窗口：262K。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f75e76c36d7849f2",
      "translationZh": "速度（单用户，我们的 sglang 构建）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70a4dffa522934ee",
      "translationZh": "在两块 48 GB GPU 上使用 BF16，解码速度为：1 K 时 25.1 token/秒，8 K 时 24.1 token/秒，32 K 时 24.1 token/秒，64 K 时 24.0 token/秒，128 K 时 23.9 token/秒",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f55cd4ef59e938b",
      "translationZh": "BF16 预填充：2,122 / 2,180 / 1,916 / 1,679 / 1,297 令牌/秒（1K 到 128K）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d1b6aa395768cf4d",
      "translationZh": "在一块 48 GB GPU 上使用 INT4（31.7 GiB），解码速度为：1 K 时 31.0 标记/秒，8 K 时 29.3 标记/秒，32 K 时 29.1 标记/秒",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "99b8fce8859017ab",
      "translationZh": "聚合吞吐量：8 位用户时为 127 tok/s，16 位用户时为 130 tok/s（BF16）；8 位用户时为 117 tok/s（INT4）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "49054cdec87bffc3",
      "translationZh": "DFlash2 起草器（单独的代码库），单用户，在同一服务器上开启或关闭时：JSON/工具输出提升最高可达 3.6 倍，代码提升 2.0 倍，思考模式提升约 1.6 倍。并发用户数大约超过 8 人时就不值得使用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a570325f95f94587",
      "translationZh": "基准测试（全部由我们在同一测试平台上使用相同设置运行，包括对比模型；完整表格和脚注见模型卡）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f71b29ea0fed9629",
      "translationZh": "在 LiveCodeBench v6（+4.2）、HumanEval（+4.3）、AIME 2025（+2.9）和 MATH-500（+1.6）上，Qwen3.8-27B 的表现领先",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "626d41838713e72d",
      "translationZh": "在 MMLU-Pro、IFEval、GPQA Diamond 上的大致水平",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ee0d31217ac2007",
      "translationZh": "在代理任务上落后：tau2-bench 为 74.2 分，而目标是 79-80 分；SWE-bench Verified（50 任务子集）为 44 分，而目标是 58-64 分。缩小这一差距是完整 v1 的主要重点，v1 将继续进行约 100 亿 token 的预训练，并加入对长时代理会话的训练。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66e7d266738c8b82",
      "translationZh": "已知限制（请在尝试前阅读）",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e47f345819566ddf",
      "translationZh": "需要我们的 sglang 构建。当前的 sglang 和 vLLM 尚未能够加载它。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b0920f18b37ba4d4",
      "translationZh": "GGUF / llama.cpp 计划中，今天不可用。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a850fa3f43a40a35",
      "translationZh": "在此预览版中，长时间的自主会话是其最薄弱的环节。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "708cf31ab24980f0",
      "translationZh": "它仍在训练中；请将此视为预览，而非最终模型。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6007067cc57adafb",
      "translationZh": "完整的启动命令位于模型卡中。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3fc7a3ba8b9d86e",
      "translationZh": "DFlash2 起草者：https://huggingface.co/Blockway/Agens-Volundr-32B-Preview-DFlash2",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f940bf9a7bf4b98",
      "translationZh": "项目页面：https://github.com/BlockWayz/Agens-Volundr",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5320d9707e0ca9e2",
      "translationZh": "服务代码：https://github.com/BlockWayz/agens-sglang",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "022aca87ed6b6aad",
      "translationZh": "Apache-2.0。我们是一个小团队，您能做的最有价值的事情就是尝试它并告诉我们它在哪儿出错：提交问题、失败的提示、或者您希望我们运行的基准测试。我们会在评论中回复。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cde8a5265f2754d2",
      "translationZh": "提交者 /u/ComfortableKindly507",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    }
  ],
